ISO-6937（DVB 文本编码）支持补丁 / ISO-6937 (DVB text charset) support patch

lib/iso6937.h 为新增编码实现：单字节 + 0xC1-0xCF 组合音符前缀，
映射表经 glibc iconvdata 实证导出（ISO_6937→UTF-32 全量往返），与
glibc 行为逐字节一致；encodings.def 末尾注册（索引追加，不打乱既有
编码序）；converters.h 挂接；aliases/canonical/flags 等 25 个生成物
全部由 tarball 自带 genaliases/genflags + gperf 依 Makefile.devel 规则
重生成。

lib/iso6937.h is the new encoding implementation: single-byte plus
0xC1-0xCF combining-accent prefixes, with the mapping table exported
empirically from glibc iconvdata (full ISO_6937→UTF-32 round trip),
byte-for-byte identical to glibc behaviour; the DEFENCODING entry is
appended to encodings.def (index appended, existing encoding order
untouched); converters.h wired; all 25 generated artifacts
(aliases/canonical/flags) were regenerated with the tarball's own
genaliases/genflags + gperf per the Makefile.devel rules.

